Subject: compiler-rt: link fuzzer tests to the configured llvm unwinder

The shared unit test flags suppress the default unwinder whenever
COMPILER_RT_USE_LLVM_UNWINDER is on. Add the configured library even
when the tests use the system c++ standard library.

diff --git a/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/tests/CMakeLists.txt b/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/tests/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/tests/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/tests/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -58,0 +59,3 @@
+elseif(COMPILER_RT_USE_LLVM_UNWINDER)
+  # Compiler-RT disables the default unwinder when using the in-tree one.
+  list(APPEND LIBFUZZER_UNITTEST_LINK_FLAGS ${COMPILER_RT_UNWINDER_LINK_LIBS})
